// Panel open: a pulse zipping up two octaves (the slide glides into the high note).
// Composed in MML for the TerraForma example game; rendered with chipsynth (python -m chipsynth sfx).
title Panel open
author Claude, at Michael Allen Wilmes's request
tempo 240
once

[instr]
zip wave=pulse pw=25 a=0 d=6 s=8 r=4 vol=12 pws=20,60,8

V1: @zip o4 c32 slide 24 6c8
